From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP defer fluid spread onto owning region

After force-partition, FlowingFluid.spreadTo can setBlock a neighbour
shard (water/lava at the cut). That is TickThread, not a reason to turn
carve off. Queue onto the owner like 0015 neighbor updates; drop if the
chunk is unloaded. Post-applyAllPatches.
---

--- a/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/net/minecraft/world/level/material/FlowingFluid.java
+++ b/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/net/minecraft/world/level/material/FlowingFluid.java
@@ -322,6 +322,26 @@
     protected abstract boolean canConvertToSource(ServerLevel level);
 
     protected void spreadTo(final LevelAccessor level, final BlockPos pos, final BlockState state, final Direction direction, final FluidState target) {
+        // YaP / Folia — after force-partition, a fluid tick on this shard can spread into
+        // a neighbour region's block. setBlock ensureTickThread would kill the region.
+        // Defer onto the owner (same as 0015 neighbor updates). Unloaded/cut: drop.
+        if (level instanceof net.minecraft.server.level.ServerLevel serverLevel
+                && !ca.spottedleaf.moonrise.common.util.TickThread.isTickThreadFor(serverLevel, pos)) {
+            if (serverLevel.getChunkIfLoaded(pos) == null) {
+                return;
+            }
+            final BlockPos immutable = pos.immutable();
+            final BlockState capturedState = state;
+            final Direction capturedDir = direction;
+            final FluidState capturedTarget = target;
+            io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.RegionizedServer.getInstance().taskQueue.queueTickTaskQueue(
+                    serverLevel,
+                    immutable.getX() >> 4,
+                    immutable.getZ() >> 4,
+                    () -> this.spreadTo(serverLevel, immutable, capturedState, capturedDir, capturedTarget)
+            );
+            return;
+        }
         if (state.getBlock() instanceof LiquidBlockContainer container) {
             container.placeLiquid(level, pos, state, target);
         } else {

